PMD Sky Sprites
by Shane Hudson, art by the PMDCollab SpriteCollab community

WHAT IT DOES
Dresses the sky: wild flyers and your FLY mount wear PMD-style
community animation sheets, eight facing directions each. With Free
Fly 1.7.0+, an eight-direction mount can fly true diagonals.

WHAT IT DOES NOT DO
Ship any official sprite. Sheets credited to Spike Chunsoft (the
official PMD art) are excluded, which currently limits coverage to
the species the community has redrawn. Nothing changes on the ground,
in battles, or for species without a community sheet.

CREDITS
Every sheet is CC BY-NC 4.0 by its SpriteCollab contributors; the
full per-species credit log ships in CREDITS.md.
